    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22513" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνωμον-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνώμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1
				</span></i>
			) <i>judging by rule</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				4.2.10
			</span></i>; <i>fit to judge of, skilled in</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					467c
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				3.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνώμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.2
				</span></i>
			.a) <i>of</i> or <i>concerning sun-dials</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεωρήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hipparch.
					1.9.8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				1.1.20
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κός, ὁ</span>, <i>expert in sun-dials,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				14.139
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				5.652
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Hyp.</u>
				5.54
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ -κή</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>), <i>the art of making them</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				1.3
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					2.1.35
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>forming a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνώμων</span> (<i><span class="en">
				11.2
			</span></i>. c), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίγωνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>in Nic.</u>
					p.71
				</span></i>
			 P. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				p.77
			</span></i> P.</div>
